{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is approached, take and check it. Perform a specific task. If not, approach/scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToStartingPosition    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
